      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, their have been events I crashed out of that killed my motivation to keep attending. Especially when I paid/took time off work to be there. A grace period for those who unintentionally disconnect would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
