      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A cool extra implementation detail I'd love to see, especially given the new instance create API as published in the recent dev log post - the ability to optionally customise the grace period on a per-instance basis, even if API only, would be massively helpful for people running events, as we can tailor the retention based on how we see the queue fill up from past event runs.\n\nUpdating this for an existing instance would be cool too, but it seems like y'all don't have an update instance metadata call at all. So at the very least, a property on instance create would be shwanky.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
