      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The grace period would be nice, but people will abuse it. If they have upwards of 5mins, they could leave the world, hop over to another world and then come back. \n\nI think the core of the problem isn't about disconnecting. Many of the crashes happen because users refuse to wear optimized avis. I see so many people crash when a very poor with a hundred toggles loads in. Even if there's a sign at the front of the club requiring people to change to an optimized avi, people refuse to do it. The best thing to do is to solve the root cause instead of patching the symptoms.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
