      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6537490d19d38e1982ab42d4|full_name} +1\n\nagree for verypoor AVI being a \"stressor\" and that patching the symptom won't solve the issue.\n\ni think some people have great PC, but poor internet connectivity, and that also affects things... whenever someone enters the lobby, their whole avatar gets analyzed and it creates a lag spike. this was also an issue where the first frame someone enters a world, the avatar loads at coordinate 0,0,0... which also create lagspikes if the avatar happens to be in your FoV \n\n(i myself barely have had this issue, but i have wired gigabit... as opposed to when i'm running on wi-fi, this used to happen quite often when people with huge avatar joins the lobby...)",
